1. line endings
   unix.txt
     line 1: "one" -> "one"
     line 2: "two" -> "two"
   no-final.txt
     line 1: "one" -> "one"
     line 2: "two" -> "two"
   windows.txt
     line 1: "one\r" -> "one"
     line 2: "two\r" -> "two"
2. a long line
   line 1: short
   line 2: StreamTooLong, skipped 41 bytes
   line 3: after
3. a large file
   file size 98894 bytes, buffer 256 bytes
   10000 lines, 98894 bytes, last line "line 10000"
